Readme for JCMBSoftPyLib

See the Wiki at GitHub for more information

Includes tools used by general JCMBsoft python tools

## Install

On Debian/Ubuntu, plain `pip install` into system Python is blocked (PEP 668).
Use either a virtual environment or `--break-system-packages`.

### Option 1: virtual environment (recommended)

    python3 -m venv .venv
    source .venv/bin/activate
    python -m pip install .

Editable (development) install:

    python -m pip install -e .

### Option 2: system Python

    python3 -m pip install --break-system-packages .

Editable (development) install:

    python3 -m pip install --break-system-packages -e .
